# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# calc 🧮 — EPRAHEMI INC. 🏢 Terminal-based arithmetic calculator
# Python-powered math evaluation engine
# Fedora MacTahoe Eprahemi Edition © 2026 — proprietary
